OL,3,GNEWSAWill new uniform rules save
OL,4,Aparents money?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new law coming into force this school
OL,7,Fterm means parents in England should
OL,8,Fhave to buy fewer branded items of
OL,9,Funiform, which the government has said
OL,10,Fwill save them money.
OL,12,FThis term uniforms will be limited to
OL,13,Fthree items with a school logo, like a
OL,14,Fblazer, jumper or sportswear ` plus a
OL,15,Ftie for secondary schools.
OL,17,FThe government said some families would
OL,18,Fsave up to #50 per child, but school
OL,19,Fwear suppliers have argued it could
OL,20,Fmean parents actually spend more in the
OL,21,Flong run.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
